msgid "Here's the info on the hitman we need you to find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr "Buona fortuna."

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, you've been invaluable in helping us capture all the hitmen in "
"Downtown Ryukyu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "It's no exaggeration to say we couldn't have done it without you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"But... It's gotten a bit crowded in here, huh? Guess we'll have to look for "
"a new place..."
msgstr ""

