msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "Sure. How can I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid "My name is Kiryu. I was sent here by Ibuki up in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "Oh, so you're Kiryu-san! Ibuki-san told me a lot about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid "He said you could help us catch the Reapers here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid "Right. Do you have any info on any of the hitmen yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I do. Before that, though, would you like to learn how to accept a "
"request?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid ""
"You can accept a request for a hitman mission from the HLA in Downtown "
"Ryukyu in the same way you would from the HLA in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid ""
"If you select \"View Requests\" when talking to the Okinawa HLA member, a list of the requests you can accept at that time will be displayed.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"When you turn over a hitman to the HLA in Downtown Ryukyu, you can take on a new mission immediately if they have any new hitman intel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid ""
"You can only accept one request for a hitman mission at a time from each of the Kamurocho and Downtown Ryukyu HLA offices.\r\n"
"Once you have accepted a request, you cannot cancel it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid ""
"Items on the list marked \"Done\" indicate missions that have already been "
"completed. You can view the mission currently underway as well as previously"
" completed missions by selecting \"Substories\" from the Pause Menu."
msgstr ""

